Subject: Keep FAPI test configuration valid after initialization
Origin: Filnix
Upstream-Status: Not submitted

init_fapi frees config_env after putenv has installed that same pointer in
environ. Copy its value with setenv so subsequent getenv calls do not read
freed storage. Keep all integration tests and their assertions enabled.

--- a/test/integration/main-fapi.c
+++ b/test/integration/main-fapi.c
@@ -506,7 +506,12 @@
         ret = EXIT_ERROR;
         goto error;
     }
-    putenv(config_env);
+    /* setenv copies the string; config_env is freed below. */
+    if (setenv("TSS2_FAPICONF", config_path, 1) != 0) {
+        LOG_ERROR("Setting FAPI configuration environment");
+        ret = EXIT_ERROR;
+        goto error;
+    }
 
     /***********
      * Call FAPI
